<title>UK: Triplex Lloyd chief exec leaves company.</title>
<headline>Triplex Lloyd chief exec leaves company.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering group Triplex Lloyd Plc said on Tuesday that chief executive Graham Lockyer was leaving the company immediately by mutual consent.</p>
<p>Finance director Bob Mitchell will take over the role until a successor is found, the company said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
